// MOVE 2b (guilford-2 .. guilford-3), Nathanael Greene #13: Guilford Courthouse, 15 March 1781, BEFORE the battle.
// Basemap guilford_hd_ref (z15, 3.86 m/px) + the 1781 geography (assets/media/guilford_1781_ref.jpg, tools/make_guilford_geo.py:
